AHB.audio({"groups": {"part-01-vocabulary": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/286170aadc00b3a2.mp3", "text": "We load the cement into a (1)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cb8d1cf0e17747ab.mp3", "text": "A truck takes it to the (2)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d8d857784daa8b4c.mp3", "text": "The goods stop at (3)… at the (4)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/57c275df416bb546.mp3", "text": "We send it by (5)…, with a (6)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-02-grammar": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/62db829aa6aad384.mp3", "text": "PREPOSITIONS OF PLACE show where: to (We ship to your country), from (It comes from Syria), in (The goods are in the port), at (It arrives at the port)."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/266f10ead8bd24e3.mp3", "text": "PREPOSITIONS OF TIME show when: on + day (on Monday), in + month (in June), at + time (at 9 o'clock)."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fa55d8b7fbf18c40.mp3", "text": "We use the PRESENT CONTINUOUS (am/is/are + verb-ing) for a plan or arrangement with a time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/36b65a04e7872180.mp3", "text": "We are shipping the goods on Monday."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/02e9de394cae4aa3.mp3", "text": "The ship is leaving at 9."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/573b6f204040a825.mp3", "text": "This is a fixed plan, not just an idea."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/02eaab466644d6de.mp3", "text": "We use BE GOING TO + verb for a plan we already have."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5ae9cf424403d1f9.mp3", "text": "We are going to send it by sea."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8b40f74c878b7b15.mp3", "text": "I am going to send the packing list."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5e30cbe6c18a8ba6.mp3", "text": "Question: Are you going to ship it today?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/94888c34e6e11576.mp3", "text": "Negative: We are not going to use a plane."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ce4f0a28d6629bc6.mp3", "text": "On for days, in for months, at for times: on Monday, in June, at 9."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b5dda4bf9259ecd5.mp3", "text": "For present continuous, use am/is/are + verb-ing (We are shipping — NOT 'We shipping')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b8d3f22ecd1516ba.mp3", "text": "For 'going to', use am/is/are going to + verb (I am going to send — NOT 'I going to send')."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-03-listening": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d5b220dc23172b5a.mp3", "text": "Listen and read. (Your teacher will read the dialogue, or play the audio.)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}, {"clips": [{"ar": "مرحباً يا فادي. متى ستشحن طلبي؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d51a96bd239babd1.mp3", "text": "Hello, Fadi. When are you shipping my order?"}, {"ar": "سنشحنه يوم الاثنين، بحراً، من ميناء اللاذقية.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/be691ca081eb4bb1.mp3", "text": "We are shipping it on Monday, by sea, from Latakia port."}, {"ar": "جيد. كيف يسافر؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/9ba6764880d99eef.mp3", "text": "Good. How does it travel?"}, {"ar": "أولاً، تأخذ شاحنة الأكياس إلى الميناء. ثم نحمّلها في حاوية.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/0dd43c47c4341dd3.mp3", "text": "First, a truck takes the bags to the port. Then we load them into a container."}, {"ar": "والجمارك؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/01df51104e97a9c5.mp3", "text": "And customs?"}, {"ar": "تجتاز البضائع الجمارك يوم الأربعاء. بعد ذلك، تُشحن على السفينة.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/06706a3d16ff84c2.mp3", "text": "The goods clear customs on Wednesday. After that, they go on the ship."}, {"ar": "كم يستغرق ذلك؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/bf71b9bc5cb3b19a.mp3", "text": "How long does it take?"}, {"ar": "نحو أسبوعين. يصل إلى مينائك في الأسبوع الأول من حزيران.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/d2c9ba7032940bcd.mp3", "text": "About two weeks. It arrives at your port in the first week of June."}, {"ar": "ممتاز. هل ستُرسل قائمة التعبئة؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c5a4c337cd6c7ded.mp3", "text": "Perfect. Are you going to send the packing list?"}, {"ar": "نعم. سأرسلها بالبريد الإلكتروني اليوم.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/1c5f31ef1cf59698.mp3", "text": "Yes. I am going to send it with an email today."}], "title": "Dialogue D1"}, {"clips": [{"ar": "كم يستغرق التسليم؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/bd5035556da9f987.mp3", "text": "How long does delivery take?"}, {"ar": "بحراً، نحو أسبوعين. براً، نحو أسبوع، لكنه يكلّف أكثر.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/fa22bb3694853423.mp3", "text": "By sea, about two weeks. By land, about one week, but it costs more."}, {"ar": "لسنا في عجلة. بحراً مناسب.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/9e07fa7448a5f782.mp3", "text": "We are not in a hurry. By sea is fine."}, {"ar": "جيد. سنشحنه بحراً يوم الاثنين.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/00cf5223fa2a6e27.mp3", "text": "Good. We are going to ship it by sea on Monday."}, {"ar": "ومتى يصل؟", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1addc831bf72a811.mp3", "text": "And when does it arrive?"}, {"ar": "في الأسبوع الأول من حزيران، في مينائك.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/78f59346c6cd96f4.mp3", "text": "In the first week of June, at your port."}, {"ar": "شكراً. هذا ممتاز.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3162d4be98591e89.mp3", "text": "Thank you. That is perfect."}], "title": "Dialogue D2"}], "part-04-speaking": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/601b38c89e6e8835.mp3", "text": "A: Ask 'When are you shipping my order?'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/18ef25594bc1e20d.mp3", "text": "B: Say the date ('We are shipping it on…')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6965d182bbe27f79.mp3", "text": "B: Describe the route (first, then, next…)."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-05-reading": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4e2c27289087a0d6.mp3", "text": "Think about a box of cement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6d21ee6930936c09.mp3", "text": "It starts in a factory in Aleppo."}, {"ar": "وينتهي في مبنى بعيد، في بلد آخر.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8d86cee0cd7c4b5a.mp3", "text": "It ends in a building far away, in another country."}, {"ar": "بين هذين المكانين، يقطع رحلة طويلة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0a2539e46c68ded6.mp3", "text": "Between these two places, it makes a long journey."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e025898eddf79f48.mp3", "text": "Most people never think about this journey."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ba4fe838885bbb18.mp3", "text": "But it is one of the most important jobs in the world."}, {"ar": "أولاً، يعبّئ العمال الإسمنت في أكياس.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a4344be87669707e.mp3", "text": "First, workers pack the cement into bags."}, {"ar": "ثم يضعون الأكياس في حاوية كبيرة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1271853813617bd0.mp3", "text": "Then they put the bags into a big container."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1db3e7640dce17e9.mp3", "text": "A truck takes the container to the port."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ed74bbb40505e185.mp3", "text": "This is the first part of the journey — by land."}, {"ar": "في الميناء، ترفع رافعة كبيرة الحاوية إلى السفينة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/52c16d7b6b4593ad.mp3", "text": "At the port, a big crane lifts the container onto a ship."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/45417f6a17d9ddf2.mp3", "text": "Then the ship sails across the sea."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e73a2d282c8f9898.mp3", "text": "This is the longest part — by sea."}, {"ar": "قد يستغرق أسبوعين أو أكثر.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/545d6fc2447d8b2f.mp3", "text": "It can take two weeks or more."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/04099c1d2dbc4f07.mp3", "text": "But there is one more stop: customs."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5785966ec80abcac.mp3", "text": "Every country has a border."}, {"ar": "عند الحدود، يفحص مكتب الجمارك البضائع.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3cfdcb4090c24661.mp3", "text": "At the border, the customs office checks the goods."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4940f05eb49cff32.mp3", "text": "Are the papers correct?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/9834e8326d41bc26.mp3", "text": "Is this the right cargo?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/35161a94b6d25fb0.mp3", "text": "Is there any tax to pay?"}, {"ar": "تنتظر البضائع في الجمارك حتى يصبح كل شيء صحيحاً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c9d957ce94d6fc82.mp3", "text": "The goods wait at customs until everything is right."}, {"ar": "لهذا السبب المستندات مهمة جداً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/80a052f57165e467.mp3", "text": "This is why documents are so important."}, {"ar": "بدون الأوراق الصحيحة، تتوقف البضائع عند الحدود، ولا يستطيع أحد تحريكها.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5185a0fa395faaaf.mp3", "text": "Without the right papers, the goods stop at the border, and nobody can move them."}, {"ar": "عندما تجتاز البضائع الجمارك، يبدأ الجزء الأخير.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/721124d54a0fa254.mp3", "text": "When the goods clear customs, the last part begins."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2142b0772a5aeb28.mp3", "text": "A truck takes the container from the port to the partner's door."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5481be2017428cdf.mp3", "text": "The journey is finished."}, {"ar": "صندوق الإسمنت، المصنوع في سوريا، صار الآن في مبنى في بلد آخر.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/84b7a7fb07a6f97f.mp3", "text": "The box of cement, made in Syria, is now in a building in another country."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/634e9b4dbc45bed2.mp3", "text": "And most people never see this journey."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/eb1f3d8b59269852.mp3", "text": "They only see the building."}, {"ar": "هذه هي القوة الهادئة للخدمات اللوجستية: تحرّك العالم، وتؤدي عملها بلا ضجيج.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0119128238ae034a.mp3", "text": "This is the quiet power of logistics: it moves the world, and it does its work without noise."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/03bc0cf702e2aed9.mp3", "text": "Every road, every port, every ship, every truck — together, they carry the things we use every day."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/acb25b908f1a9ab4.mp3", "text": "Logistics is invisible when it works well."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/481e13e4ed39d276.mp3", "text": "But it is the reason the world can trade."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e1d7239ae77ad6d9.mp3", "text": "A box of cement makes a long (1)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cb8d1cf0e17747ab.mp3", "text": "A truck takes it to the (2)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fbd8bc3b3c3690fd.mp3", "text": "A ship carries it across the (3)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ef552b0e6d23ee17.mp3", "text": "At the border, (4)… checks the goods and the papers."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0090d0726164c762.mp3", "text": "Then a truck takes it to the partner."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/49d81f499a38b79a.mp3", "text": "Logistics is (5)… when it works well, but it moves the (6)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-06-writing": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2f22b45b5d070c4d.mp3", "text": "I said when we are shipping (on Monday…)."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-07-trade-skills": [{"clips": [{"ar": "عندما تسافر البضائع بين البلدان، تكون المستندات بأهمية البضائع نفسها.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/21ffc81826857f7c.mp3", "text": "When goods travel between countries, the documents are as important as the goods."}, {"ar": "أهم مستند هو قائمة التعبئة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c42e465b8a304388.mp3", "text": "The most important document is the PACKING LIST."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1d460d360d4e4f2b.mp3", "text": "It says exactly what is in the container: the product, the quantity, the number of boxes or bags, and the weight."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5b0d15c768382f1d.mp3", "text": "Why is this so important?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1c3d6acf3e78f5f4.mp3", "text": "Because of customs."}, {"ar": "لكل بلد حدود، ولكل حدود مكتب جمارك.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/faa16bde2acdab4d.mp3", "text": "Every country has a border, and every border has a customs office."}, {"ar": "عندما تصل البضائع إلى الحدود، يقرأ مكتب الجمارك قائمة التعبئة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3a845dae2eb31ec4.mp3", "text": "When the goods arrive at the border, the customs office reads the packing list."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8374bdeb32ad1247.mp3", "text": "It checks: is this the right cargo?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/73cfd8824ccb77d7.mp3", "text": "Is the quantity correct?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/35161a94b6d25fb0.mp3", "text": "Is there any tax to pay?"}, {"ar": "إذا كانت الأوراق صحيحة، تجتاز البضائع الجمارك، وتستطيع المتابعة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a8eec7eb51f2d565.mp3", "text": "If the papers are correct, the goods clear customs, and they can continue."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c8a332d3fa17f66e.mp3", "text": "If the papers are wrong, or missing, the goods stop."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b0cf1903bb272400.mp3", "text": "They wait at the border."}, {"ar": "وهذا يكلّف وقتاً ومالاً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a37c2453157d68e2.mp3", "text": "This costs time and money."}, {"ar": "لذلك يجهّز فريق لوجستي جيد المستندات بعناية دائماً، ويرسلها مبكراً دائماً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/89fd5aa8664bb5ac.mp3", "text": "So a good logistics team always prepares the documents carefully, and always sends them early."}, {"ar": "تذكّر: لا تتحرك البضائع أسرع من الأوراق.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/14ebf8d0569fd62e.mp3", "text": "Remember: the goods can only move as fast as the papers."}, {"ar": "المستندات الجيدة تعني تسليماً سريعاً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/780b2b799532fdbb.mp3", "text": "Good documents mean fast delivery."}, {"ar": "المستندات السيئة تعني شحنة عالقة عند الحدود.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a47b38c4d51d19aa.mp3", "text": "Bad documents mean a shipment stuck at the border."}, {"ar": "في الخدمات اللوجستية، الأوراق ليست مملّة. إنها المفتاح الذي يفتح كل حدود.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e7b80a94092768d4.mp3", "text": "In logistics, the paperwork is not boring — it is the key that opens every border."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-08-consolidation": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/113fb8a898cc773e.mp3", "text": "It is Monday morning."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4b9402fe31f4ee41.mp3", "text": "The container of cement is ready."}, {"ar": "تأخذها شاحنة من المصنع في حلب إلى ميناء اللاذقية.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2116ab1f7c621432.mp3", "text": "A truck takes it from the factory in Aleppo to Latakia port."}, {"ar": "في الميناء، ترفعها رافعة كبيرة إلى السفينة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/86a6c504c841e5ba.mp3", "text": "At the port, a big crane lifts it onto the ship."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/046beb4e02be30be.mp3", "text": "Fadi watches, and he is happy."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cb2bb7828112b86c.mp3", "text": "Everything is on time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1268bed68550d8bd.mp3", "text": "But logistics needs care."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8abf6610d13be777.mp3", "text": "On Tuesday, Fadi checks the shipment."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a0fea1a33c7b7dcb.mp3", "text": "He sends Ms. Chen a short message: “Good news."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/34dccfff15ad333b.mp3", "text": "Your order is at Latakia port."}, {"ar": "يجتاز الجمارك غداً، ثم يُشحن على السفينة.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/25fd124616eb7d14.mp3", "text": "It clears customs tomorrow, and then it goes on the ship."}, {"ar": "يصل خلال أسبوعين تقريباً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/593f95056e387e8c.mp3", "text": "It arrives in about two weeks.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5787e9ff26b5042b.mp3", "text": "Ms. Chen is happy."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c501fe0d00c4dfaa.mp3", "text": "She knows exactly where her goods are."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/758537ef4e58e845.mp3", "text": "“This is good service,” she thinks."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/25b07eccf02f1ece.mp3", "text": "“They tell me the news."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/7696c5e61ea33c81.mp3", "text": "I am not waiting in the dark.”"}, {"ar": "بعد أسبوعين، تصل السفينة إلى ميناء نورث بريدج.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3285231921fac02d.mp3", "text": "Two weeks later, the ship arrives at NorthBridge's port."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6be812178305e084.mp3", "text": "A truck takes the container to NorthBridge's door."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5481be2017428cdf.mp3", "text": "The journey is finished."}, {"ar": "تكتب السيدة تشِن إلى فادي. الإسمنت هنا، وهو ممتاز.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/22a765924b28ef52.mp3", "text": "Ms. Chen writes to Fadi: “The cement is here, and it is perfect."}, {"ar": "شكراً على الشحن الجيد، وعلى كل التحديثات.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/001da303dd16cc6a.mp3", "text": "Thank you for the good shipping, and for all the updates.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d0e154ca38ddc1f9.mp3", "text": "Fadi is proud."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/ef4f7c51caa8878e.mp3", "text": "“We made good cement,” he thinks."}, {"ar": "ونقلناه بأمان، في موعده، عبر البحر.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4e6cb416d97f5190.mp3", "text": "“And we moved it safely, on time, across the sea."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/836039e5cbefd139.mp3", "text": "Good products and good logistics — together, they make a happy partner."}, {"ar": "والشريك السعيد يعود.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5f83ec367e5593e9.mp3", "text": "And a happy partner comes back.”"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-09-cases": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/7f2eff1f3234f56f.mp3", "text": "A shipment arrives at the border."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/16b2d9fc0d22a6d3.mp3", "text": "But there is no packing list."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d75f22efad4ffde8.mp3", "text": "The customs office cannot check the goods, so it stops the shipment."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/063a5d47166a0046.mp3", "text": "The goods wait at the border for days."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6e438b8e62e7f022.mp3", "text": "Write one sentence to tell the customs office what is in the container."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cb4b947187b7ec69.mp3", "text": "A partner needs 5,000 tonnes of cement, but they are not in a hurry."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/00f04c22cc6d44c5.mp3", "text": "By sea is cheaper but slower."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5442dc39951a78ec.mp3", "text": "By land is faster but more expensive."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5b9999bf9f8b94a1.mp3", "text": "You ship a partner's order, but you do not send any updates."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cdd2a8f5194f347f.mp3", "text": "The partner does not know where the goods are."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c2e24968fa41f05a.mp3", "text": "They are worried, and they send many emails to ask."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-10-review": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/35f01f640927e06b.mp3", "text": "We are shipping the order by sea on Monday."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/822a33af635b1a5a.mp3", "text": "First, a truck takes the container to Latakia port."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0c0f1448873c69e0.mp3", "text": "Then the goods clear customs."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/92751e5a096a0641.mp3", "text": "After that, they go on the ship."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/63910e8bc99c2dc1.mp3", "text": "It arrives at the partner's port in about two weeks."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/7f840955899b231e.mp3", "text": "We send the packing list with the shipment."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4ec3ecf6a18ca3d9.mp3", "text": "[Teacher reads] 'We are shipping your order on Monday, by sea, from Latakia port."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/6fafe9045fc22628.mp3", "text": "The goods clear customs on Wednesday."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/513aa2d158a713d7.mp3", "text": "It arrives at your port in about two weeks.'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/669a311acad3e3be.mp3", "text": "I can describe how goods travel, step by step."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8a99043edc05d0cf.mp3", "text": "I can use prepositions of place and time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/17150a8b8c5f591f.mp3", "text": "I can talk about plans and arrangements."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/bf53a572d853ea83.mp3", "text": "I can write a short shipping-update message."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-11-foundations": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/73e28b327e85f558.mp3", "text": "This unit is about shipping."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5e65c4f965347bb3.mp3", "text": "But it points to a big idea: the world is full of systems you never see."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5076c2672eefe11b.mp3", "text": "Logistics is one of them."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/16605c1da271b83a.mp3", "text": "Every day, ships, trucks, and planes move millions of boxes around the world."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/526a7a73ce250e86.mp3", "text": "You do not see this."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cf64145667860b9d.mp3", "text": "But it is the reason your shop has food, your city has fuel, and your building has cement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/15136757db3bb1c7.mp3", "text": "When the system works, it is invisible."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f9f46b9c4ada6740.mp3", "text": "You only notice it when it stops."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f2ed472aade4b4c5.mp3", "text": "Think about it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/93284702738026b6.mp3", "text": "When you buy something, you see the shop and the box."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c45ebbf506cacb1b.mp3", "text": "You do not see the long journey — the factory, the truck, the port, the ship, the customs office."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f52235500c874981.mp3", "text": "All of this happens quietly, behind the scenes."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e5fa5207407e08ab.mp3", "text": "Thousands of people do this work every day, and most of us never think about them."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d506e7dae4e4b59f.mp3", "text": "But without them, the world stops."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3334e38d2b555af7.mp3", "text": "No cement for buildings."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2a1b53573bcb454b.mp3", "text": "No food for shops."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/783a701f0e8a1da4.mp3", "text": "No fuel for cars."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/fe191c9fba01d36c.mp3", "text": "The invisible system holds up the visible world."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/909cd49fd245842c.mp3", "text": "This is true of many systems, not just logistics."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cc302e07e5b76718.mp3", "text": "Think of the water in your tap, the power in your lights, the roads under your car."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3db8f1ec275b9118.mp3", "text": "You do not see these systems."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2b36aaafa7f2fdee.mp3", "text": "You only use them."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3f46738d44fb9028.mp3", "text": "And this teaches us something important."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8ffba599d5132e64.mp3", "text": "The most valuable work is often the quiet work that nobody sees."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/31f9f908e845d780.mp3", "text": "The person who packs the box, checks the papers, and loads the ship is not famous."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0241bc24094cb1c5.mp3", "text": "But their careful work moves the world."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f6c376f817e9dbf3.mp3", "text": "So as you work in trade, remember two things."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0a3356caa9b9802b.mp3", "text": "First, respect the invisible systems, and the people who keep them working."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d29cdf7e5dd61e70.mp3", "text": "They do a great and quiet job."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8702835cbdd7ca6b.mp3", "text": "Second, do quiet, careful work yourself: a good packing list, a clear update, an on-time shipment."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/10623dc5189b92db.mp3", "text": "Then you are part of this great system."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/47248476dd6ab33f.mp3", "text": "Your work can be invisible."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/5a055b95c28359a7.mp3", "text": "But it matters."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2e4367f537cb019f.mp3", "text": "It helps goods move, partners trust, and the world trade."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cbd56e1c14b8f8ad.mp3", "text": "And that is something to be proud of, even when nobody sees it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a72cbdc5a59e1030.mp3", "text": "Choose one thing near you (food, a phone, cement)."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2038ef43e06186de.mp3", "text": "Think about its long journey to you: the factory, the transport, the shop."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0b92dc106811a3b1.mp3", "text": "How many people helped it travel?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/baad79989a3727a4.mp3", "text": "Write a few sentences (30–50 words) about how goods travel from your country to a partner."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/524f940652b2ab77.mp3", "text": "Use 'first, then, next, finally' and prepositions of place and time."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "warm-up": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/8a980a0c42b1d2a6.mp3", "text": "Look at the pictures."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4fd321bc9b662ce4.mp3", "text": "Answer these questions before you read."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2203afcfa94114b8.mp3", "text": "NorthBridge's order is ready."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/665d885d44ab9101.mp3", "text": "Now the goods travel to NorthBridge's country."}, {"ar": "هذا هو عمل الخدمات اللوجستية: نقل البضائع من مكان إلى آخر.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a9a8887b3ba53f81.mp3", "text": "This is the job of logistics — moving goods from one place to another."}, {"ar": "في الحسن، تقوم شركة الشحن كوموش بهذا العمل.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3bb2d4b18b91bc4c.mp3", "text": "At Al-Hasan, the freight company Komosh does this work."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/e92a10c3434df492.mp3", "text": "Karim talks to Fadi."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c3e2e3590a3254a8.mp3", "text": "“The cement is ready in Aleppo,” he says."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1b159943d481db3c.mp3", "text": "“How do we send it to NorthBridge?”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d89ab72adb891713.mp3", "text": "Fadi checks the plan."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f84cce88a0a6bab2.mp3", "text": "“We are shipping it by sea,” he says."}, {"ar": "أولاً، تأخذ شاحنة الأكياس من المصنع في حلب إلى ميناء اللاذقية.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d9f0d5091ee62cc7.mp3", "text": "“First, a truck takes the bags from the factory in Aleppo to Latakia port."}, {"ar": "ثم نحمّل الحاوية.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/d68a698289a1f8b6.mp3", "text": "Then we load the container."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/74a87a88189844e7.mp3", "text": "Next, the goods clear customs."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/92751e5a096a0641.mp3", "text": "After that, they go on the ship."}, {"ar": "أخيراً، تبحر السفينة إلى ميناء نورث بريدج.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0d25d06a161ee782.mp3", "text": "Finally, the ship sails to NorthBridge's port.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f2ddeb4a910ffd59.mp3", "text": "“How long does it take?” asks Karim."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/3f570fbd4010a05d.mp3", "text": "“About two weeks by sea,” says Fadi."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/29d0e130168df5aa.mp3", "text": "“By land, it is faster, but the roads are long."}, {"ar": "بحراً. فهو أرخص للطلب الكبير.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4ce5bf223c83b069.mp3", "text": "By sea, it is cheaper for a big order.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a13b2d7bbc0c94a7.mp3", "text": "Fadi prepares the documents."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/60401008fc3069ae.mp3", "text": "The most important one is the packing list."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0b74c8ee3785b0c2.mp3", "text": "It says what is in the container: 1,000 tonnes of cement, in 20,000 bags, in two containers."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/beac9329801bf1e8.mp3", "text": "The customs office needs this document."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/cc246f2cdcee700d.mp3", "text": "Without the right papers, the goods cannot cross the border."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/1dc27a5106025ae1.mp3", "text": "“When are we shipping it?” asks Karim."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/79e167337c4591ea.mp3", "text": "“We are shipping it on Monday,” says Fadi."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/a5b192166a010373.mp3", "text": "“The ship leaves Latakia at 9 in the morning."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/04645be4e3d1932b.mp3", "text": "It arrives at NorthBridge's port in about two weeks."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/0608d9874b49f8e2.mp3", "text": "I am going to send Ms. Chen an update, with the date and the packing list.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/c5e02133a5e8764f.mp3", "text": "Fadi writes to Ms. Chen: “Dear Ms. Chen, good news."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/7413beaa1084a579.mp3", "text": "We are shipping your order by sea on Monday."}, {"ar": "يصل خلال أسبوعين تقريباً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/82f4977321821bda.mp3", "text": "It arrives in about two weeks."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/4114f86713f345fb.mp3", "text": "Best, Fadi.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/b81ad92992be2230.mp3", "text": "“Good work,” says Karim."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/f8f689922424fac6.mp3", "text": "“Now the goods are on their way."}, {"ar": "هذه هي الخدمات اللوجستية: العمل الهادئ الذي يحرّك العالم.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/2acd8749656b6b3c.mp3", "text": "This is logistics: the quiet work that moves the world.”"}], "title": "Read and listen"}]}, "unit": 6});
